<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Dear&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName},</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div><font face="arial">We are looking forward to welcoming you to the ASU Tempe Campus in August as a music major! Because your theory diagnostic exam score was below the minimum required to begin the MTC 125 Basic Music Theory course, you are required to complete the Fundamentals of Music Notation online course with a final grade of C or better this summer. At this time you have not started the course.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Please email <a href="mailto:musicadmissions@asu.edu">musicadmissions@asu.edu</a> to inform us that you have completed the course and the final exam.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><b>**Please note that you will be <u>un-enrolled from MTC 125</u> if you do not complete this course in its entirety by August 1, 2015 at 12:00 p.m.**</b></font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">In order for you to remain enrolled in MTC 125 Basic Music Theory for the fall semester, login with your ASURITE credentials and access the course by the following link:</font></div><div><font face="arial"><a href="https://herbergeronline2.asu.edu/musicfundamentalsR/"><br></a></font></div><div><font face="arial"><a href="https://herbergeronline2.asu.edu/musicfundamentalsR/">https://herbergeronline2.asu.edu/musicfundamentalsR/</a></font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Please do not hesitate to contact us if you have any questions about the contents of this email.</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Sincerely,</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b style="font-size: 12pt;">Julie Stephens</b></div><div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" color="#999999">Coordinator, Academic Affairs + Admissions</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><b><font color="#990000">Arizona State University</font>&nbsp;|&nbsp;</b></font><b style="color: rgb(255, 204, 0); font-size: 12pt;">Herberger Institute for Design and the Arts&nbsp;</b></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(153, 153, 153);">P.O. Box 870405 |&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(153, 153, 153);">Tempe, Arizona 85287-0405</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#999999">Phone: 480-965-5069</font></div><div><font face="arial" color="#ffffff">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
